{
 "comment": "Plugin-panel pattern (see mopho/tg55 layouts). PRESET: preset levels + live main vol / bypass / tempo-tap CCs and the Alpha Mod wheel (CC 1) with its per-preset settings. ROUTING: the 8x8 grid, one row at a time (shared row select, columns 1-4 and 5-8 in two groups). EFFECT KEYS: the 12 front-panel bypass keys as live CC toggles. BLOCK / BLOCK I/O / ALGORITHM PARAMS: one shared select (select.shared = 'block'; the picker is drawn only in BLOCK, the other groups follow it) over the 18 block instances (dyn1-3, fil, for, dis, voc, syn1-2, pit, cho1-2, dly1-2, rev, pan1-2, eq); P1..P16 are generic slots whose real names/units/ranges depend on {b}Algo -- look them up in fireworx.json algorithms[family][algo].slots (like tg55's fxParam1-3). Slots a block doesn't have are simply not drawn. EXT 1-8 are live CC knobs that move whatever the current preset's matrix links them to -- the only real-time control path. MOD rows: LFO/ADSR/ENV/pitch detector/functions/freeform, then the 20 matrix links. Everything except the CC controls needs the expanded-format address map before it sends or reads (see fireworx.json driverNotes 16).",
